---
import '../../scripts/vendor/anatomy/iso.css'
import '../styles/anatomy.css'
import { decisionHeroSvg } from '../lib/decision-hero.mjs'
---

<figure class="decision-hero iso">
  <div class="decision-hero-inner">
    <div class="decision-hero-copy">
      <pre class="decision-hero-code"><code><span class="c">// the smart if-statement</span>
p = small_model.decide(request)

<span class="k">if</span> p &gt;= 0.90  <span class="g">generate()</span>
<span class="k">elif</span> p &gt;= 0.60 <span class="m">review()</span>
<span class="k">else</span>           <span class="r">stop()</span></code></pre>
      <p class="decision-hero-line">
        A small model decides the path. A capable model does the work.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="decision-hero-art" set:html={decisionHeroSvg} />
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Illustrative thresholds. Teams set their own cutoffs from evidence,
    calibration and the cost of mistakes.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
